/ActualText (Blockchain technology is an advanced database mechanism that allows transparent information sharing within a business network. A blockchain database stores data in blocks that are linked together in a chain. Blockchain technology eliminates the need for a trusted party to facilitate digital relationships and is the backbone of cryptocurrencies. )
