/ActualText (We have been through brainstorming and identified that money theft is a problem that many blockchain technology users face. There are a lot of users who are getting scammed by various brokers or by some people they trust to give their information. These are the problems mainly faced by newcomers to blockchain technology.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
