/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 131 0 R
/ActualText (Following the interview, it became evident that the user faced problems with money theft during transactions on a trading application. Additionally, the user fell victim to scams, receiving deceptive emails, messages, or links posing as authentic trading platforms. Unaware, users ended up disclosing their login details on these fraudulent sites, allowing attackers to steal their information.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
